              </Text>
              <Text as="p" variant="bodySm" tone="subdued">
                10001, Manhattan, allowed, Delivery available!, 2-3 days, Yes, 30-day returns
              </Text>
              <Text as="p" variant="bodySm" tone="subdued">
                33101, Miami, blocked, Sorry we don&apos;t deliver here,,No,
